# Console React components

Hand-written components in `console/src` must use **`React.FC`** (not `function` declarations).

```tsx
import type React from "react";

export const Example: React.FC = () => <div />;

type CardProps = { title: string };
export const Card: React.FC<CardProps> = ({ title }) => <h2>{title}</h2>;
```

**Exceptions (do not convert):**

- `console/src/components/ui/**` — shadcn-generated; preserve for `shadcn add` / reinstall
- `console/src/main.tsx` — entrypoint
- Hooks and `src/lib/**` — not components

Full console conventions: `console/AGENTS.md`
